  "description": "Reid Let’s Commute | Electric commuter bike\nComfortable, practical and built for everyday journeys – the Reid Let’s Commute combines smooth electric assistance, reliable components and a relaxed riding position for city travel.\nThe Reid Let’s Commute is designed to make everyday cycling easier, whether you're commuting to work, navigating city streets or running daily errands. Its alloy frame features internal cable routing and an integrated 352Wh battery, creating a clean, streamlined design with balanced handling. Finished in a striking blue colour, it offers a distinctive look for everyday urban riding.\nA responsive 250W rear hub motor provides electric assistance to help you tackle inclines and navigate city routes with greater ease. The Ananda D19 handlebar-mounted display features Bluetooth connectivity and app compatibility, keeping essential ride information within easy reach. An L-TWOO 7-speed trigger shifter paired with a Shimano rear derailleur provides practical gearing for adapting to changing urban terrain.\nTektro hydraulic disc brakes with 180mm rotors front and rear deliver reliable stopping power and control in varying conditions. Wide 700 x 45c commuter tyres provide added stability and cushioning over potholes and uneven road surfaces, helping create a smoother, more comfortable ride.\nAn oversized 700mm alloy riser bar supports a relaxed, upright riding position, while comfortable rubber grips and a plush city comfort saddle enhance comfort on longer journeys. With its commuter-ready features and practical design, the Let’s Commute is built to make everyday travel more convenient.\nThe Let’s Commute is ideal for:\n\nEveryday commuters looking for a comfortable, electric-assisted way to travel to work\n\nCity and urban riding, with a practical setup for navigating streets and cycle routes\n\nRiders tackling hills and varied terrain, with a 250W rear hub motor and 7-speed gearing\n\nComfort-focused cyclists, with wide 700 x 45c tyres, rubber grips and a city comfort saddle\n\nConfident urban riding, with Tektro hydraulic disc brakes and 180mm rotors front and rear\n\nRiders who prefer an upright position, with a wide 700mm riser bar for added control\n\nDaily journeys and errands, with an integrated 352Wh battery and a Bluetooth-compatible display\n\nPlease make sure to familiarise yourself with eBike safety information before charging or using your new Reid. You can view and download user manuals and safety instructions here.",
